          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yep, I made the `col_set_str` mistake along the way and got a column of binary mess. :smile:\n\nAnnoying bookkeeping is done and posted as an update in this merge request.  I think it makes an agreeable improvement to the usability of the Telnet dissection, so the annoyance was probably worthwhile.\n\nThanks again for the feedback and guidance.",
